    "scenesThatPass": [
      "EMILY: Emily Jennings. Child Services? We spoke on the phone...?\nMARGARET: You said the seventeenth.\nEMILY: Today is the seventeenth.\nMARGARET: Is not.",
      "EMILY: Come down, I'd like to meet you.\nEMILY: My name's Emily. What's yours?\nLUCY: Lucy.\nEMILY: Pretty name. Pretty girl.",
      "EMILY: I knew someone at school named Lucy, she was a writer. Do you ever write? I do sometimes, it helps me sort out how I'm feeling.\nEMILY: Okay, I just shot like a gallon of water up my nose. So much for establishing trust.\nEMILY: What's happening to you? I can help. Let me help.\nEMILY: What is it, sweetheart?",
      "EMILY: I just wanted you to know I haven't forgotten about you. I'm doing everything I can.\nLUCY: If I disappear will you come look for me?\nEMILY: You're not going to disappear.\nLUCY: If I do?",
      "EMILY: Group therapy for kids, what's that say about the world?\nEMILY: Good news. You get to leave here tomorrow.\nLUCY: Doug said I might have to go to a state home.\nEMILY: Only for a few days, till we find a better place."
    ]
  },
