  "plot": "A dedicated social worker takes a special interest in the case of a vulnerable 10-year-old girl whose parents appear to be abusing her. After rescuing the child and taking her into her own home, she begins to experience a series of terrifying and unexplained events involving the people around her. As she investigates the girl's disturbing past, she discovers a horrifying supernatural secret that turns the child she believed she was protecting into a deadly threat. Forced to confront her own fears and fight for survival, she must find a way to escape the terrifying force that has entered her life.",
